  "description": "The industry’s top headhunter launches a survival project, leading five job-hunting underdogs! The “moment of truth,\" where you force your cover letter past the application cutoff and shatter the interviewer’s rigid mindset with your image! Can we really pull this off? What is the true story of these human resources (HR) professionals that unfolds beyond the doors of employment? The story of a mysterious headhunter and job seekers on the brink of despair!\n\n(Source: Justoon, translated)",
